#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:10
msgid ""
"The [full topic synthesis](modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md) "
"tracks work-unit calculation, edit, verification, local export, local "
"filing, external-evidence reconciliation and amendment. A registry-pinned"
" source mesh combines profile, ledger, invoices, withholding and prior "
"declarations into a content-addressed BORRADOR revision. Verification "
"checks filing-grade authority, source completeness, ledger drift and "
"model-specific evidence. Local export writes an artifact; local filing "
"creates a PRESENTADO revision whose AEAT status remains pending. External"
" receipt/register matching is the separate promotion path; an amendment "
"again starts as a pending local correction. Calculation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Local filing "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) Reconciliation"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-and-"
"profile-bindings.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[082](../articles/082-review-package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-"
"persistence.md), [083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-"
"presentation-and-verification.md))"
msgstr ""
"La [síntesi completa del tema](modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-"
"part-1.md) segueix el càlcul, l’edició, la verificació, l’exportació "
"local, la presentació local, la conciliació d’evidències externes i la "
"rectificació d’unitats de treball. Una xarxa de fonts amb registre fixat "
"combina perfil, llibre major, factures, retencions i declaracions "
"anteriors en una revisió BORRADOR adreçada pel contingut. La verificació "
"comprova autoritat apta per a la presentació, completesa de fonts, "
"desviacions del llibre major i evidències específiques del model. "
"L’exportació local escriu un artefacte; la presentació local crea una "
"revisió PRESENTADO amb estat de l’AEAT encara pendent. La correspondència"
" externa de rebuts o registres és la via separada de promoció; una "
"rectificació torna a començar com una correcció local pendent. Càlcul "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verificació "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Presentació "
"local (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) "
"Conciliació "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-and-"
"profile-bindings.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[082](../articles/082-review-package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-"
"persistence.md), [083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-"
"presentation-and-verification.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:12
msgid ""
"The stage gates preserve source/override precedence, typed provenance, "
"registry revision identity and exact profile/period authority. An edit "
"baseline is short-lived and value-free; active execution supports "
"scalar/binding edits while refusing row intents. M123 with captured "
"withholding refuses calculation through export pending a settled count "
"rule; M193 prior-accrual settlement has a later filing/export refusal. "
"M036 records and operator observations are local assertions; M145 is a "
"payer communication, with filing/submission links explicitly refused. "
"Report PDF signatures are pinned to a profile key only when store "
"verification succeeds, and expressly do not claim AEAT status. Edit "
"admission (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_admission.py`) M123 gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) M145 "
"ownership (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`) Report"
" verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_verification.py`) "
"([071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-and-pdf-"
"verification.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-help-"
"dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-"
"contracts-and-modelo-export.md), [075](../articles/075-modelo-history-"
"invoice-withholding-capture-and-iva-wallet.md), [076](../articles/076"
"-local-observations-m036-records-and-m145-communications.md), "
"[077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-previews-and-spreadsheet-"
"operations.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-derived-bindings-and-"
"filing-readiness.md))"
msgstr ""
"Els controls d’etapa conserven precedència de fonts i substitucions, "
"procedència tipada, identitat de revisió del registre i autoritat exacta "
"de perfil i període. Una base de referència d’edició és de curta durada i"
" sense valors; l’execució activa admet edicions escalars i de "
"vinculacions mentre refusa intencions de files. M123 amb retencions "
"capturades refusa des del càlcul fins a l’exportació pendent d’una regla "
"de recompte resolta; la liquidació de meritacions anteriors de M193 té un"
" refús posterior de presentació i exportació. Els registres M036 i les "
"observacions de l’operador són afirmacions locals; M145 és una "
"comunicació al pagador, amb enllaços de presentació i tramesa "
"explícitament refusats. Les signatures dels informes PDF es fixen a una "
"clau de perfil només quan la verificació del magatzem té èxit, i "
"expressament no afirmen estat de l’AEAT. Admissió d’edicions "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_admission.py`) Control M123 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) "
"Titularitat M145 (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`)"
" Verificació d’informes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_verification.py`) "
"([071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-and-pdf-"
"verification.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-help-"
"dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-"
"contracts-and-modelo-export.md), [075](../articles/075-modelo-history-"
"invoice-withholding-capture-and-iva-wallet.md), [076](../articles/076"
