"[077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-previews-and-spreadsheet-"
"operations.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-derived-bindings-and-"
"filing-readiness.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:14
msgid ""
"Scoped concerns include calculation advisories running after revision "
"persistence, export event recording before file publication, verification"
" report and revision writes in separate steps, sticky wallet overrides, "
"helpers that reopen default authority rather than reuse a pin, and "
"feedback import without visible replay-nonce consumption. The accountant "
"package uses member hashes, signatures and recipient encryption, but "
"trust in a recipient key still needs out-of-band checking. Quickfile ends"
" at local export; M100-from-M130 projection is explicitly an estimate. "
"Post-persist work "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Export sequence"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`) Feedback route "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_exchange_operation.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [080](../articles/080-modelo-projections-queries-"
"quickfile-and-recipient-encryption.md), [081](../articles/081"
"-reconciliation-filing-disposition-and-accountant-review-packages.md))"
msgstr ""
"Les preocupacions delimitades inclouen avisos de càlcul executats després"
" de persistir la revisió, registre d’esdeveniments d’exportació abans de "
"publicar el fitxer, escriptures d’informe de verificació i revisió en "
"passos separats, substitucions persistents de cartera, funcions auxiliars"
" que reobren l’autoritat per defecte en lloc de reutilitzar una fixació i"
" importació de retorns sense consum visible del nonce de reproducció. El "
"paquet per al comptable utilitza empremtes de membres, signatures i "
"xifratge del destinatari, però la confiança en la clau del destinatari "
"encara necessita comprovació fora de banda. Quickfile acaba a "
"l’exportació local; la projecció de M100 des de M130 és explícitament una"
" estimació. Treball posterior a la persistència "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Seqüència "
"d’exportació (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`) Via de retorns "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_exchange_operation.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [080](../articles/080-modelo-projections-queries-"
"quickfile-and-recipient-encryption.md), [081](../articles/081"
"-reconciliation-filing-disposition-and-accountant-review-packages.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:20
msgid ""
"This part follows a declaration from profile-bound work unit through "
"calculation, review, verification, local export, local filing, external "
"evidence reconciliation, and amendment. The stages have distinct "
"authority: a calculated draft records a result, a verified revision is "
"filing grade under local checks, an export is a local artifact, a local "
"filing record remains pending AEAT confirmation, and an external receipt "
"or register observation can later support reconciliation. The application"
" registers operations around these existing service authorities, "
"generally binding exact profile, selected period, revision and operation "
"receipt. Calculation action "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Local filing "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_actions.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-and-"
"verification.md))"
msgstr ""
"Aquesta part segueix una declaració des d’una unitat de treball vinculada"
" al perfil a través de càlcul, revisió, verificació, exportació local, "
"presentació local, conciliació d’evidències externes i rectificació. Les "
"etapes tenen autoritats diferents: un esborrany calculat registra un "
"resultat, una revisió verificada és apta per a presentació segons "
"controls locals, una exportació és un artefacte local, un registre local "
"de presentació continua pendent de confirmació de l’AEAT i un rebut "
"extern o una observació de registre poden donar suport posterior a la "
"conciliació. L’aplicació registra operacions al voltant d’aquestes "
"autoritats de servei existents, generalment vinculant perfil exacte, "
"període seleccionat, revisió i rebut d’operació. Acció de càlcul "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verificació "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Presentació "
"local (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_actions.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-and-"
"verification.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:22
msgid "Calculation and work inspection"
msgstr "Inspecció de càlculs i treballs"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:24
msgid ""
"Calculation preparation chooses an active work unit and law-selected, "
"pinned registry snapshot; it validates canonical casilla and binding "
"channels, detail rows, profile readiness, source-sensitive ledger "
"preflight, and for Modelo 303 an IVA-wallet decision. The source mesh "
"composes ledger IVA/Renta, invoices, withholding, inventory, foreign "
"assets, prior filings, relations and model-specific sources. Ownership "
"rules reject competing source values; caller overrides are limited to "
"declared carry/manual policy. The formula engine emits typed observations"
" with operands, legal/source references and an operator-layer replay "
"payload, then persists a content-addressed BORRADOR revision and ledger "
"fact anchor. Registry route tables check that executable resolvers are "
"enrolled once. This produces a calculation, not an export or filing. "
"Preparation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_calculation_preparation.py`) Input "
"routing (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculate_input.py`) Mesh "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Route ownership"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_route.py`) Revision "
"persistence (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [071](../articles/071-calculation-"
"findings-reports-and-pdf-verification.md), [082](../articles/082-review-"
"package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-persistence.md))"
msgstr ""
"La preparació del càlcul tria una unitat de treball activa i una "
"instantània fixada del registre seleccionada segons la llei; valida "
"canals canònics de caselles i vinculacions, files de detall, preparació "
"del perfil, comprovació prèvia del llibre major sensible a les fonts i, "
"per a Modelo 303, una decisió de cartera d’IVA. La xarxa de fonts compon "
"IVA i renda del llibre major, factures, retencions, inventari, actius "
"estrangers, presentacions anteriors, relacions i fonts específiques del "
"model. Les regles de titularitat rebutgen valors de font competidors; les"
" substitucions del cridador es limiten a la política declarada "
"d’arrossegament o manual. El motor de fórmules emet observacions tipades "
"amb operands, referències legals i de fonts i una càrrega de reproducció "
"de la capa de l’operador, i després persisteix una revisió BORRADOR "
"adreçada pel contingut i una àncora de dades del llibre major. Les taules"
" de rutes del registre comproven que els resolutors executables "
"s’inscriguin una vegada. Això produeix un càlcul, no una exportació ni "
"una presentació. Preparació "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_calculation_preparation.py`) "
"Encaminament d’entrades "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculate_input.py`) Xarxa "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Titularitat de "
"rutes (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_route.py`) "
"Persistència de revisions "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [071](../articles/071-calculation-"
"findings-reports-and-pdf-verification.md), [082](../articles/082-review-"
"package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-persistence.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:26
msgid ""
"Input precedence is explicit: profile facts, source mesh, selected "
"Borrador 100 prefill, then admitted caller overrides. Profile binding "
"resolves date/enum/boolean/decimal channels under the pinned authority "
"and retains profile fingerprints; absent family or territory facts remain"
" unresolved. The Borrador route is opt-in by snapshot ID and accepts only"
" registry-marked AEAT-prefilled bindings. Work-review rows explain every "
"selected casilla's formula, realized source, provenance, blockers and "
"completeness role. Help cards render formula and dated parameters from "
"the same snapshot; they explain, but do not recalculate. Declarations "
"workspace/calendar project local and AEAT-evidence availability "
"separately, retaining stale/unreadable states and an unlinked AEAT "
"completion as distinct. Binding precedence "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/binding_resolution.py`) Profile binding "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/profile_binding.py`) Borrador selection "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/borrador_binding.py`) Work review "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_work_review_assembly.py`) Calendar "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/declarations_calendar.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-"
"and-profile-bindings.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-"
"help-dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-"
"derived-bindings-and-filing-readiness.md))"
msgstr ""
"La precedència d’entrades és explícita: dades del perfil, xarxa de fonts,"
" emplenament previ seleccionat d’esborrany de 100 i després substitucions"
" admeses del cridador. La vinculació de perfil resol canals de dates, "
"enumeracions, booleans i decimals sota l’autoritat fixada i conserva "
"empremtes del perfil; les dades familiars o territorials absents "
"continuen sense resoldre. La via d’esborrany és optativa per "
"identificador d’instantània i accepta només vinculacions marcades al "
"registre com a preemplenades per l’AEAT. Les files de revisió del treball"
" expliquen la fórmula, la font materialitzada, la procedència, els "
"bloquejos i el rol de completesa de cada casella seleccionada. Les "
"targetes d’ajuda mostren fórmules i paràmetres datats de la mateixa "
"instantània; expliquen, però no recalculen. L’espai de treball i el "
"calendari de Declaracions projecten separadament disponibilitat local i "
"d’evidències de l’AEAT, conserven estats obsolets o il·legibles i "
"diferencien una compleció de l’AEAT no vinculada. Precedència de "
"vinculacions (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/binding_resolution.py`) "
"Vinculació de perfil "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/profile_binding.py`) Selecció "
"d’esborrany (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/borrador_binding.py`) "
"Revisió del treball "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_work_review_assembly.py`) Calendari "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/declarations_calendar.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-"
"and-profile-bindings.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-"
"help-dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-"
"derived-bindings-and-filing-readiness.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:28
msgid ""
"Advisories name limits instead of fabricating values: "
"descendant/maternity and nursery evidence, M210 treaty conditions, "
"M303/M349 divergence, M720 redeclaration, capital-goods/prorrata "
"settlement and missing official boxes can produce diagnostics. Some are "
"nonblocking, while selected source issues persist as blocking revision "
"notes consumed later; other nonblocking notes are only process-local. "
"M202 has a stricter all-declared-bindings requirement. Modelo 123 with "
"captured withholding is explicitly blocked across calculate, verify, "
"local filing and export because its official rent-count unit is "
"unresolved. Modelo 193 settled prior-accrual rows likewise stop "
"filing/export where payment-year authority is absent, while remaining "
"inspectable at verification. Diagnostic collection "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_diagnostics.py`) Note gates "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_note_gate.py`) M202 gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_required_binding_gate.py`) M123 refusal"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) M193 "
"refusal (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m193_settled_row_gate.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-"
"work-projections.md), [071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-"
"and-pdf-verification.md), [076](../articles/076-local-observations-m036"
"-records-and-m145-communications.md), [077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-"
"private-previews-and-spreadsheet-operations.md))"
msgstr ""
"Els avisos identifiquen límits en lloc de fabricar valors: evidències de "
"descendents, maternitat i llar d’infants, condicions de convenis M210, "
"divergència M303/M349, redeclaració M720, liquidació de béns d’inversió i"
" prorrata i caselles oficials absents poden produir diagnòstics. Alguns "
"no bloquegen, mentre que incidències seleccionades de fonts es "
"persisteixen com a notes bloquejants de revisió consumides posteriorment;"
" altres notes no bloquejants són només locals al procés. M202 té un "
"requisit més estricte de totes les vinculacions declarades. Modelo 123 "
"amb retencions capturades està explícitament bloquejat en càlcul, "
"verificació, presentació local i exportació perquè la unitat oficial de "
"recompte de rendes no està resolta. Les files liquidades de meritacions "
"anteriors de Modelo 193 també aturen presentació i exportació quan manca "
"autoritat de l’any de pagament, però continuen inspeccionables en "
"verificació. Recollida de diagnòstics "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_diagnostics.py`) Controls de"
